<BlogPost
  title="Getting the Arched Look in Shiloh and Eclipse: Contour Doors, Arched Inserts, and Custom Arches"
  description="Arches are back. Here's how to spec them in Shiloh and Eclipse: Contour Doors from the spec book (glass-prep available, wall sizes 24″–48″), square doors with arched insert panels, and fully arched doors by custom quote."
  author="Ben Miller"
  publishedDate="2026-06-09"
  ogImage="/images/blog/arched-cabinet-doors-shiloh-eclipse/listing-card.webp"
